## I. BREAK MAP â€” Diem gay can patch ngay (Ordered by kill-impact)

### GAP-01 | P0 | brain/src/ â€” ORPHAN CRATE (Khong compile duoc)

```yaml
severity: P0_COMPILE_BLOCKER
location: engine/hace/brain/src/
finding: >
  Thu muc nay chua KHONG CO Cargo.toml.
  brain/src/{block,op,compose,core,facade,registry} la code vat ly ton tai
  nhung khong thuoc bat ky crate nao trong workspace.
  Khong the compile, khong the test, khong the import.
evidence:
