  - "brain_block.rs line 3: 'use crate::vkm::LayerKv' â€” module 'vkm' khong ton tai"
  - "brain_block.rs line 4: 'use crate::abi::tensor::ArenaHandle' â€” module 'abi' khong ton tai"
  - "operator_registry.rs line 4: 'use std::collections::HashMap' â€” vi pham no_std"
action_required:
  option_A: >
    Tao crate 'hace-brain-ops' tai engine/hace/brain/ops/ voi Cargo.toml,
    di chuyen brain/src/op/* vao day, xoa BOM char (UTF-8 BOM prefix \xEF\xBB\xBF
    hien dien trong matmul.rs va brain_block.rs).
  option_B: >
    Xoa toan bo brain/src/ va REUSE fem/hacedle/src/ops/* (da ton tai, da test,
    no_std-safe). Xem GAP-05 ve duplication.
  csa_recommendation: option_B  # Force reuse, zero new crate
  owner: CTO
  blocking: GAP-03, GAP-05
```

### GAP-02 | P0 | attention_weighted_sum â€” ALWAYS RETURNS ZEROS (Logic bug)

```yaml
severity: P0_LOGIC_BUG
locations:
  - "engine/hace/fem/hacedle/src/ops/attention.rs::attention_weighted_sum()"
  - "engine/hace/brain/src/block/attention.rs::attention_weighted_sum()"
finding: >
  Ca hai ham attention_weighted_sum() deu tra ve Vec<f32> all-zeros.
root_cause:
  hacedle_ops: >
    'let output = vec![0.0f32; ...]' â€” khai bao IMMUTABLE.
    Dong ghi gia tri bi comment out voi ghi chu 'Cannot assign to vec!'.
    Dev nham: can 'let mut output'.
  brain_src_block: >
    'let scores = vec![0.0f32; n_heads * n_heads]' â€” IMMUTABLE.
    Vong for tiep theo ghi 'scores[i * n_heads + j] = sum / ...' se COMPILE ERROR
    vi scores la immutable. File nay khong compile duoc.
impact: "Moi attention output deu la zero â€” inference hoan toan sai"
fix_required:
  hacedle_ops: "doi 'let output' thanh 'let mut output', bo comment dong ghi"
  brain_src: "Khong can fix â€” xoa theo option_B cua GAP-01"
  owner: CTO/Cogen
  effort: "15 phut â€” chi la 'let mut'"
```

