### GAP-08 | P1 | BrainMasterRuntime.execute() â€” VOID DISPATCH

```yaml
severity: P1_DISPATCH_DEAD
location: "engine/hace/brain/master/src/lib.rs::BrainMasterRuntime::execute()"
code: |
  pub async fn execute(&self, sio: RuntimeSio) -> Result<SioOutcome, &'static str> {
      let session = BrainSession::from_sio(sio);  // tao session
      let outcome = SioOutcome::default();          // outcome rong
      Ok(outcome)                                   // tra ve ngay, khong lam gi
  }
finding: >
  execute() khong goi dispatcher, khong goi provider, khong goi ZeusRuntime.
  Toan bo infrastructure (ProviderRegistry, ProviderSelector, ProviderFactory,
  CandleProvider, LlamaProvider) KHONG DUOC SU DUNG.
required_flow: |
  execute(sio):
    1. ProviderSelector.select(&sio) -> ProviderType
    2. ProviderRegistry.select(Capability::Inference) -> provider_id
    3. provider.execute(&sio) -> SioOutcome
    Hoac (preferred E4):
    1. extract InferRequest from sio.intent.objective
    2. ZeusRuntime.execute(ReasonCtx) -> ReasonResult
    3. map ReasonResult -> SioOutcome
action: >
  Wire execute() theo required_flow option 2 (ZeusRuntime path).
  ZeusRuntime da co, AlgoParticle da hoat dong.
  Sau khi GAP-04 done (HacedleBrain), wire local_ce = HacedleBrain.
owner: CTO
```

